sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Dev as Developer
  participant NPM as NPM / Package
  participant CLI as CLI (feature-assured)
  participant VSCode as FeatureAssured Ext
  participant Local as Local Project
  participant Tests as Tests
  participant Steps as Generic StepDefs
  participant Cmd as Custom Commands
  participant Res as Resolvers
  participant POM as Generic POM/Impl
  participant Service as Service Clients
  participant External as External APIs
  participant Webpack as Webpack
  participant Dist as Dist Bundle
  participant GH as GitHub Actions
  participant Registry as NPM Registry
  participant CI as CI (FeatureAssured Docker)

  Note over Dev,NPM: Install the library as dependency
  Dev ->> NPM: npm install @yassinouhadi/cypress-generic-package
  NPM -->> Dev: Adds `cypress/`, `bin/cli.js`, `dist/`, step-defs

  Note over Dev,CLI: Developer runs CLI to scaffold or setup BDD-ready config
  Dev ->> CLI: npx feature-assured init / run
  CLI -->> Local: generate page objects, example tests, templates

  Note over Dev,VSCode: Or use the FeatureAssured extension to visually scaffold
  Dev ->> VSCode: open project, use extension
  VSCode ->> Local: generate/sync templates
  VSCode -->> CLI: sync templates (optional)

  Note over Local,Tests: Developer customizes or extends Generic objects
  Local ->> POM: extend Generic Objects (Buttons, Forms, Pages)
  Local ->> Steps: customize or call Generic Step Definitions

  Note over Tests,Steps: Test execution path
  Tests ->> Steps: run step (Given/When/Then)
  Steps ->> Cmd: call custom command / helper
  Cmd ->> Res: delegate to resolver (pom or service)
  Res ->> POM: use Generic POM implementation (UI actions)
  Res -->> Cmd: UI result
  Cmd ->> Steps: return result to step
  Steps -->> Tests: assertion / test flow continues

  Note over Res,Service: Service calls flow
  Cmd ->> Res: request service operation
  Res ->> Service: call REST/GraphQL/SOAP client
  Service ->> External: network call
  External -->> Service: response
  Service -->> Res: response
  Res -->> Cmd: returns service data

  Note over Dev,Webpack: Build / publish flow
  Dev ->> Webpack: npm run build (webpack + tsc -> dist)
  Webpack ->> Dist: produce UMD bundle (dist/cy-generic-objects.js)
  Dev ->> GH: push tag/commit
  GH ->> Registry: GitHub Actions builds and publishes to NPM
  Registry -->> NPM: package available for install

  Note over CI,Tests: CI execution using Feature Assured Docker image
  CI ->> Local: checkout repo + npm ci
  CI ->> CI: use FeatureAssured Docker image (has cypress + preprocessors)
  CI ->> Tests: run cypress run (uses installed package, CLI-generated tests)
  Tests ->> Service: may call or mock Service Clients
  Tests -->> CI: results (reports)

  Note over Dev,Local: Summary
  Dev -->> Local: developer writes/extends tests using provided building blocks
